                    </ul>

                    <h3>2. Following the Curriculum Scope</h3>
                    <p>It is recommended to follow the sequential flow of modules starting from <em>Lesson 1 (History)</em> up to <em>Lesson 6 (Framing)</em> to better grasp the foundations of digital and traditional animation.</p>

                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; color: #1e293b;">3. Project Submissions & Guidelines</h3>
