                     <ul>
                        <li><strong>File Naming Convention:</strong> Always use the standard format before uploading or submitting your outputs: <code>LastName_FirstName_TaskNumber.mp4</code> (e.g., <em>Santos_Juan_Task1.mp4</em>).</li>
                        <li><strong>Software & Assets:</strong> Ensure all vector files, keyframe layouts, and exported video formats comply with the standard requirements specified per module.</li>
                     </ul>
                    </p>

